{{Quote|Snow cones|Street sign on Pantora|<ref name="Infiltration" />}}
A '''shop''' selling [[snow cone]]s was located in the [[central marketplace]] of [[Ro Station]], a [[city]] on [[Pantora]].<ref name="Cornered">{{TBB|Cornered}}</ref> Another such shop was located in an unnamed city where [[Riyo Chuchi]] met up with [[Avi Singh]]. The shop used [[Color|yellow]] and pink signage written in [[Aurebesh]] to attract customers.<ref name="Infiltration" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the ''[[Star Wars: The Bad Batch]]'' episode "[[Cornered]]," the word "snow cones" appears, written in [[Aurebesh]], on a street sign behind [[Fennec Shand]] as she says to [[Omega]], "You seem lost." However, the letters are so unclear that one can barely make out their shape.<ref name="Cornered" /> The sign reappears in the episode "[[Infiltration (episode)|Infiltration]]," where the characters are seen clearly.<ref name="Infiltration" />

